This is because the Windows version of GGIR has not been updated to 1.9-2 yet, see: https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=GGIR <https://cran.r-project.org/package=GGIR>
Usually it takes a couple of days before a new version is available on all operating systems. CRAN has separate processes for Linux, OSx, and Windows
Vincent

